flowchart TD
    P['Codex agent prompt<br/>codex exec'] -->|UserPromptSubmit| POL['armor policy list / add / template<br/>staged as a diff, risk warnings']
    POL --> GATE['human types armor yes in the terminal<br/>agent cannot self-apply']
    P --> REG['register intent plan<br/>mcp__armorcodex-policy__register_intent_plan<br/>goal + steps: tool, reason, inputs']
    REG --> STORE['Plan stored locally<br/>no backend key required']
    STORE --> CALL['Bash tool call from the agent']
    CALL -->|PreToolUse hook| PARSE['parse intent: normalized tool name + parameters']
    PARSE --> CHK{'matches a plan step and the policy?'}
    CHK -->|on-plan| ALLOW['allow · command executes<br/>echo planned-ok · exit 0']
    CHK -->|off-plan parameters: intent mismatch| MODE{'ARMORCODEX_MODE'}
    CHK -->|tool not in plan: intent drift| DENY['permissionDecision: deny<br/>command never executed']
    MODE -->|enforce default| DENY
    MODE -->|monitor| LOG['command runs, logged only']
    PARSE -.->|missing or malformed payload: fail closed| DENY
    ALLOW --> POST['PostToolUse hook<br/>execution result captured']
    LOG --> POST
    POST --> AUD['runtime.json audit trail on disk<br/>evidence receipt: plan, decision, session']
